      "writtenOn": "2022-01-25T09:43:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know but when I use `if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_FPU_WARNINGS))` and CONFIG_FPU_WARNINGS is not defined, then compiler compiler will produce errors about missing variables which are referenced under `if (IS_ENABLED(...`\n\nI just don\u0027t want to increase memory footprint much when CONFIG_FPU_WARNINGS is not enabled.",
      "parentUuid": "14212e41_231ffe6f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 100,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 100,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "36b7c4a022daad7f83a8f83c9801636d1aa33a78",
