        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-26T19:04:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you\u0027ll have to add an #ifdef around the static variables in that case. Or even better for readability, adding __maybe_unused should work.",
      "parentUuid": "b9cc2fad_d8e03a66",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 100,
        "startChar": 0,
